{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は人生で初めて\n雲丹を食べました！\n5月4日は雲丹食べた記念日になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな人生初のうにを食べた時\nお隣にいたのは、\n人生で一生イチ押しのこの方でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に\n寿司が美味しく感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寿司自体が十年ぶりとかかも。\nお魚が食べれるように最近なったのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寿司クール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会のお洋服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"dress: Rosarymoon\nSneaker: コンバース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩出しになるよ。背中も胸元もあいてて、ラップスカートで脚がチラ見えで大人可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりと形違いでお揃いでかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"onepiece: BonBon"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中村りさちゃんプロデュースの肩出しチュールワンピ。黒のチュールが可愛くて好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみんなありがとう。♡\n生ドルの反響がすごくて、\nその話題が多かったかも(o･v･)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は、名古屋がれいか\n京都がみなみでした*´｀*\nみなみとはお揃いの羊ヘアーやったよ。\n(写真撮るの忘れてた)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteen手に取って頂けましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月はいつもより多く出てます\n有難いです(；＿；)(；＿；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなアンケ送ってくれたりありがとうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいチェックしてほしい○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りは76ページの\nおっきくうつってるやつかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/05/07/2637378/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと自分を出せる場所だから、\nみんなにみてほしいです。頑張ります>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち☆☆"}],"source":"archive"}